    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup before first run\n\n**1. Add these 5 columns to the 'Lead Pool' tab (headers only):**\n`email_check_result`  `accept_all`  `email_is_role`  `sendability`  `email_verified_at`\n\n**2. Create the MillionVerifier credential**\nn8n → Credentials → New → **Query Auth** (NOT Header Auth — MillionVerifier takes the key as a query param)\n- Name: `api`\n- Value: your MillionVerifier API key\n- Save it as: **MillionVerifier API**\nThen open the 'MillionVerifier: Verify' node and select it.\n\n**3. Re-select the Google Sheets credential** on both Sheets nodes if they show a warning after import.\n\n**4. Tune MAX_PER_RUN** in 'Select Emails To Verify' (default 200) to control credit burn.\n\n**5. Run Manual Test Trigger first.** Check the Lead Pool for populated sendability values, then activate.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "a21d56cc-c3b9-4857-86dc-df08c420287e",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        176,
        -176
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What this does\n\nTakes emails already sitting in the Lead Pool (381 of them at last count, but only 3 ever verified) and runs each through MillionVerifier.\n\nWrites back a single **`sendability`** column that the email outreach workflow gates on:\n\n- `sendable` — result ok, not a role account. Safe to email.\n- `role_account` — ok but info@/admin@ style. Deliverable, poor for cold outreach.\n- `risky_catch_all` — domain accepts everything; can't confirm the mailbox exists.\n- `do_not_send` — invalid or disposable.\n- `unknown` — verifier couldn't determine. Leave alone.\n\nSkips anything already verified, already emailed, or unsubscribed, so re-runs only spend credits on new rows.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "062a6c80-f866-457a-97d0-9f5cbade1d45",
      "name": "How It Works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        688,
        -176
      ]
    },
